# Plan Reader — keep the corpus, vector DB, caches, and secrets OUT of git (regenerable / private).
# (This module was added as a subfolder; these rules are relative to plan_reader/.)
00_input/plans/**/*.pdf
00_input/plans/**/*.md
00_input/plans/**/*.json
00_input/_md_cache/
06_chroma/
02_outputs/per_plan/
02_outputs/scorecards/*.json
.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
